  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>RF_Switch_Safety</name>
    <x>595</x>
    <y>625</y>
    <width>450</width>
    <height>55</height>
    <text>Masks 1 or 2 mean MIXED state and are treated as unsafe. Startup and reconnect never move the physical switch.</text>
    <font>
      <font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="11.0" />
    </font>
    <foreground_color>
      <color red="105" green="115" blue="125" />
    </foreground_color>
    <wrap_words>true</wrap_words>
    <transparent>true</transparent>
  </widget>
  <widget type="label" version="2.0.0">
    <name>Switch_Global_Note</name>
    <x>35</x>
    <y>755</y>
    <width>1030</width>
    <height>45</height>
    <text>These controls operate individual hardware switches only. They are NOT burn authorization. The coordinated safety interlock and burn sequencer are milestone 5A/5B.</text>
    <font>
      <font family="Liberation Sans" style="REGULAR" size="12.0" />
    </font>
    <foreground_color>
      <color red="105" green="115" blue="125" />
    </foreground_color>
    <wrap_words>true</wrap_words>
    <transparent>true</transparent>
  </widget>
